      "description": "A new, unsaved diagram in a tab of its own: the starter of a style, or the text given. D2 styles are flowchart, architecture, sequence, entity, class, state, org and grid; Mermaid ones are flowchart, sequence, class, state, entity, gantt, pie, mindmap, timeline, journey and git. A canvas (JSON Canvas 1.0 with the extension in docs/canvas-extension.md) has one starter. Returns whether it drew and, if not, its mistakes.",
      "live": true,
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
