      "ref": "yavc.diagrams/edit@1",
      "title": "Change a Diagram's Shapes",
      "description": "One change to a D2 diagram, made as the visual editor makes it, through D2's own editing: create a shape (key a, or a.b for b inside a) or a connection (key \"a -> b\"); set a label (key a), a shape (key a.shape) or a style (key a.style.fill), with value, or no value to take it away; delete a shape or a connection (key (a -> b)[0]); rename a shape (name); move a shape into or out of a container (to, the new full name); or reconnect a connection (from, to). D2 writes the whole text again in its own layout. Returns the key the change made and whether the diagram still draws.",
      "live": true,
      "inputSchema": {
        "type": "object",
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "required": [
          "op",
          "key"
        ],
